# ConcatTransform branch: 17 values where a 4 by 4 matrix needs 16. gman is
# expected to stop with RIE_CONSISTENCY.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
ConcatTransform [ 2.125 2.25 2.375 2.5 2.625 2.75 2.875 3 3.125 3.25 3.375 3.5 3.625 3.75 3.875 4 4.125 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
